{
 "hook-1": {
  "start": 0,
  "duration": 482,
  "audioFrames": 473,
  "audioSec": 16.06,
  "chapter": "hook",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "抢票那一刻，你点下购买，屏幕却弹出一句：系统繁忙，请稍后再试。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 6.483
   },
   {
    "text": "很多人以为是网站坏了。",
    "start": 6.763,
    "dur": 1.888
   },
   {
    "text": "其实很多时候，它没坏，是故意拦了你一下，好让后面的人和你自己都还能买到。",
    "start": 8.931,
    "dur": 6.844,
    "revoiced": "hook-1-s2-a"
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep10-timing.json:hook-1"
 },
 "hook-2": {
  "start": 494,
  "duration": 106,
  "audioFrames": 96,
  "audioSec": 3.2,
  "chapter": "hook",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 494,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "为什么要拦？",
    "start": -0.005,
    "dur": 1.035
   },
   {
    "text": "先去景区门口看一看。",
    "start": 1.31,
    "dur": 1.904
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep10-timing.json:hook-2"
 },
 "no-limit-1": {
  "start": 600,
  "duration": 373,
  "audioFrames": 365,
  "audioSec": 12.167,
  "chapter": "no-limit",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "假设一个景区一次只装得下一千人，节假日却来了一万人。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 5.489
   },
   {
    "text": "要是大门敞开，所有人一起涌进去，路被堵死，到处挤满了人，谁都玩不成。",
    "start": 5.769,
    "dur": 6.399
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep10-timing.json:no-limit-1"
 },
 "no-limit-2": {
  "start": 973,
  "duration": 220,
  "audioFrames": 210,
  "audioSec": 7.0,
  "chapter": "no-limit",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 373,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "网站也是这样：请求一下子太多，服务器被挤垮，连原本能买到票的人也买不到了。",
    "start": 0.015,
    "dur": 6.994
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep10-timing.json:no-limit-2"
 },
 "limit-1": {
  "start": 1193,
  "duration": 442,
  "audioFrames": 384,
  "audioSec": 13.073,
  "chapter": "limit",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "办法是在门口限量放人。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 2.606
   },
   {
    "text": "里面每秒接待得了多少，门口就每秒放多少，超出的人先在外面等一等。",
    "start": 2.886,
    "dur": 6.448,
    "revoiced": "limit-1-s1-a"
   },
   {
    "text": "这种主动控制放人的做法，叫限流。",
    "start": 9.614,
    "dur": 3.177,
    "revoiced": "limit-1-s2-c"
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep10-timing.json:limit-1",
  "origDuration": 392,
  "holdAt": 392,
  "extraHold": 50,
  "labelHold": 50
 },
 "limit-2": {
  "start": 1560,
  "duration": 307,
  "audioFrames": 297,
  "audioSec": 10.219,
  "chapter": "limit",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 367,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "每秒放多少，叫每秒请求数，简称 QPS。",
    "start": -0.002,
    "dur": 4.561,
    "revoiced": "limit-2-s0-b"
   },
   {
    "text": "你看到的那句系统繁忙，就是门口在说：再等等。",
    "start": 4.841,
    "dur": 5.047
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep10-timing.json:limit-2"
 },
 "token-bucket-1": {
  "start": 1887,
  "duration": 280,
  "audioFrames": 272,
  "audioSec": 9.067,
  "chapter": "token-bucket",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "门口怎么数人？",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 1.459
   },
   {
    "text": "常用的办法叫令牌桶。",
    "start": 1.739,
    "dur": 2.25
   },
   {
    "text": "门口放一个桶，按固定的速度往里放门票，一秒放几张。",
    "start": 4.269,
    "dur": 4.796
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep10-timing.json:token-bucket-1"
 },
 "token-bucket-2": {
  "start": 2167,
  "duration": 334,
  "audioFrames": 324,
  "audioSec": 10.8,
  "chapter": "token-bucket",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 280,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "来一个人拿走一张，拿到票才能进，桶空了就请你稍后。",
    "start": 0.012,
    "dur": 4.343
   },
   {
    "text": "没人来的时候，票会在桶里攒一些，所以一小波人突然到来，也能先放进去。",
    "start": 4.635,
    "dur": 6.174
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep10-timing.json:token-bucket-2"
 },
 "breaker-1": {
  "start": 2501,
  "duration": 434,
  "audioFrames": 373,
  "audioSec": 12.704,
  "chapter": "breaker",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "限流管的是门口，还有两招常跟它一起用。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 3.156
   },
   {
    "text": "要是里面某个景点出了故障，导游先不往那边带人，直接说暂停开放，过一会带几个人试试，没问题再恢复，这叫熔断。",
    "start": 3.436,
    "dur": 9.001,
    "revoiced": "breaker-1-s1-a"
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep10-timing.json:breaker-1",
  "origDuration": 381,
  "holdAt": 381,
  "extraHold": 53,
  "labelHold": 53
 },
 "breaker-2": {
  "start": 2879,
  "duration": 315,
  "audioFrames": 257,
  "audioSec": 8.567,
  "chapter": "breaker",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 378,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "人实在太多时，先关掉拍照打卡这种不重要的项目，保住最主要的游览，这种做法就叫降级。",
    "start": 0.013,
    "dur": 8.554
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep10-timing.json:breaker-2",
  "origDuration": 267,
  "extraHold": 48,
  "holdAt": 267,
  "labelHold": 34
 },
 "recap-1": {
  "start": 3146,
  "duration": 426,
  "audioFrames": 417,
  "audioSec": 14.214,
  "chapter": "recap",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "放在一起看：消息队列让订单排好队、不容易丢；而限流，让门口不被挤爆。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 7.014,
    "revoiced": "recap-1-s0-a"
   },
   {
    "text": "上一期和这一期合起来，就是网站扛住高峰的两招：一个让人排队，一个让人分批进门。",
    "start": 7.294,
    "dur": 6.624
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep10-timing.json:recap-1"
 },
